CLIProxyAPI: add validated JSON passthrough configuration and config auths.

Keep passthrough groups independent of chat compatibility, preserve grouped v8
settings through the loader/extractor predicate, synthesize keyed auths, resolve
aliases by group identity/index and expose management auth indexes. The route
consumer is supplied in the same PR; this config/auth portion is not standalone.
Applied after key-allowlist and zai-tool-shims with --fuzz=0.
Rationale: packages/cliproxyapi/docs/cliproxyapi-passthrough.md.

